"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Among these two, I’d investigate the earlier-arriving Turkish award first: it reaches Bangkok 4h 35m before the other shown award and has a 4h 31m shorter elapsed journey, with the same reported Turkish points amount. The tradeoff is a separate SFO–LAX cash leg before the award; the tickets’ connection protection is unverified.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J63@2027-01-08T08:36-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Earlier Bangkok arrival\",\"v\":\"The award itinerary is reported as business, with a stop at Istanbul. The SFO–LAX cash access quote is USD 59, but its price scope is unknown; the 150-minute LAX transfer is a real separate-ticket risk, not proof of a protected connection.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The later option is a useful timing alternative if its Alaska-operated access leg suits you: it has the same reported Turkish points amount and award route, but arrives later. Its LAX transfer is 149 minutes, and its access quote also has unknown price scope.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J115@2027-01-08T08:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Later-arriving alternative\",\"v\":\"This award is also reported as business and connects at Istanbul. Its SFO–LAX cash access quote is USD 59; the scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For cash context, the searched SFO–BKK itinerary is a two-stop route via Seattle and Seoul, with an observed USD 452 fare. That is a search benchmark, not an all-in comparison: its price scope is unknown, and it is not the same routing as the awards.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash search benchmark\",\"v\":\"Observed fare: USD 452, scope unknown; two stops via SEA and ICN.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For both awards, 275,000 points is the reported amount, but its quote scope is unknown; fees and reliable seat counts are also unavailable. The business label does not establish every leg’s cabin. Award traveler support is unknown, and the separate-ticket connection and permission to reposition are unverified. Search coverage was partial, and availability and prices need confirmation before booking.\"}]}"
